# RED (Person disjointWith Organization, the LinkML axiom gen-owl dropped): an investigator that is
# also a funding agency. Both are pairwise-disjoint node classes too; this pins the Agent split.
@prefix bbqs: <https://brain-bbqs.org/schema#> .
@prefix bid:  <https://brain-bbqs.org/id/> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
bid:x a bbqs:Investigator , bbqs:FundingAgency .
